        {
            "ref_slug": "online-course-crs-welcome",
            "title": "Welcome and how this works",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Welcome and how this works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_7}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_7}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-233\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page covers how the course runs and where to find things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the modules work</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Each module</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">A recording, a worksheet, and anything referenced on the call</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">New modules</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Open up as we reach them</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Recordings</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Up within a day</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your access</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Stays open after the course ends</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where to start</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Read this page, then have a look at the recommended tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Work through Module 1 before the next session</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Come back to any module whenever you need it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Do the worksheets. Watching the recordings on their own doesn't change much.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If you get stuck</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leave a comment on the module page you're stuck on. Other people on the course can see the answer too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "online-course-crs-welcome",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "online-course-crs-tools",
            "title": "Recommended tools",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recommended tools</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of this is required. It's what past groups ended up using. All of them have a free tier or a trial.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Project management</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_8}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_8}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1790\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Task management for client projects. Set up a template for each type of job so you never miss a step. The free tier covers most solo freelancers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://asana.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">asana.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_9}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_9}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1791\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Notes, docs and wikis in one place. Good for a client-facing knowledge base or your own procedures. Takes longer to learn than Asana.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://notion.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">notion.so</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Communication</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_10}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_10}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1792\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short screen recordings for client updates, feedback walkthroughs and handovers. Quicker than a long email, and clients can watch when it suits them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://loom.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">loom.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_11}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_11}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1793\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scheduling without the back and forth. Set your availability, share the link, and clients book themselves in. The free tier covers one event type.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://calendly.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">calendly.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Finance</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_12}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_12}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1794\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Free invoicing and accounting. Estimates, invoices and basic bookkeeping. Enough for most solo freelancers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://waveapps.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">waveapps.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_13}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_13}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1795\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simple time tracking. Even if you bill flat rates, it shows you which jobs take more hours than they should.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://toggl.com/track/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">toggl.com/track</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You don't need all of these</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with one tool from each category and get used to it before adding another. We'll talk through which ones fit how you work on the calls.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
            "post_name": "online-course-crs-tools",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "online-course-crs-module-1",
            "title": "Module 1: Clients",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Module 1: Clients</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_14}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/video-embed-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1111\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An ideal client profile is about working style, budget and how they make decisions, more than who they are.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The clients who wear you down usually gave you a sign in the first conversation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Saying no to the wrong fit is easier when you've written down what the wrong fit looks like.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can ask qualifying questions on a call without it feeling like an interview.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the next session</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write your ideal client profile in five bullets</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>List the three warning signs you've ignored before</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Try the qualifying questions on your next enquiry</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ideal client worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discovery call script</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "online-course-crs-module-1",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "online-course-crs-module-2",
            "title": "Module 2: Systems",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Module 2: Systems</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_14}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/video-embed-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1111\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A process you keep in your head is a process only you can run.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write it down roughly first. You can tidy it later.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Most of the time saved comes from the handful of things you do on every job.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Templates go stale. Put a date in the calendar to look at them again.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the next session</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Map one process from start to finish</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Turn the emails you retype most into templates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Upload your process map before the next session</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Process mapping worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Email template pack</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "online-course-crs-module-2",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "online-course-crs-feedback",
            "title": "Course feedback",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course feedback</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Takes a couple of minutes. I read every one and use them to change the next run of the course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Tally embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal works with any form tool that gives you an embed code. This one is built in Tally, but Gravity Forms, Typeform, Google Forms or whatever you already use works the same way. Paste the embed code into a content page and the form shows here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What the form asks</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>👍 What was most useful, and why</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>👎 What didn't work, or what you'd cut</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>💬 What you would tell someone thinking about doing the course</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>📣 Whether you're happy for me to quote you</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "online-course-crs-feedback",
            "meta": []
        }
    ],
